  "copyright_text": "©2026 Microids SA. Developed by Breakfirst SAS. Published by Microids SA. All rights reserved. Based on the board game King of Tokyo designed by Richard Garfield (Three Donkeys LLC). King of Tokyo ©2016-2026 IELLO SAS. King of Tokyo, IELLO and their logos are trademarks of IELLO. All rights reserved.",
